===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|en|enm|sound}}, {{m|enm|sund}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sund||the power, capacity, or act of swimming; swimming; sea; ocean; water; sound; strait; channel}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*sundą||swimming; sound}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*swem-||swimming; sea}}.

Cognate with {{cog|nl|zond||sound; strait}}, {{cog|da|sund||sound; strait; channel}}, {{cog|sv|sund||sound; strait; channel}}, {{cog|is|sund||sound; strait; channel}}. Related to {{l|en|swim}}.

